{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Planet untamed. Future uncertain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as a scout for alien life. Your mission is simple: collect information for your human creators before they arrive. But this world does not bow to human hands. And maybe, <strong>neither should you.\u00a0</strong>Who are you? A <strong>pawn</strong>? A <strong>protector</strong>? A <strong>predator</strong>?  Or something else entirely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Take Flight. Find Your Truth.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear</strong> \u2013  Learn the secret rhythms of the wild <strong>on your own terms.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place within the cycle or disrupt it entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift between towering canopies, boom through caverns, and track the echoes of a <strong>long-abandoned human terraforming attempt.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Discover the beauty and brutality of a living ecosystem.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flora, fauna, and environment interact in surprising and systemic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action ripples through the world.  Nature will <strong>remember.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush valleys flood with seasonal blooms, predators stalk under the cover of darkness, and storms force you to rethink your movement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Speak the Language of the Wild </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your power\u2014<strong>create, destroy, and understand.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udce1 Echolocate</i></strong><i> \u2013 Reveal the hidden. Map the unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udde3 <strong>Shout</strong> \u2013 Send shockwaves through the land itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Whisper</strong> \u2013 Form bonds that  last a lifetime\u2026 or shatter in an instant.</i> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3221630?t=1748993364","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3221630?t=1748993364","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221630/53a5251f5f0960ad3116bd51736bed43959311b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748993364","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221630/53a5251f5f0960ad3116bd51736bed43959311b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748993364","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Planet untamed. Future uncertain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as a scout for alien life. Your mission is simple: collect information for your human creators before they arrive. But this world does not bow to human hands. And maybe, <strong>neither should you.\u00a0</strong>Who are you? A <strong>pawn</strong>? A <strong>protector</strong>? A <strong>predator</strong>?  Or something else entirely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Take Flight. Find Your Truth.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear</strong> \u2013  Learn the secret rhythms of the wild <strong>on your own terms.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your place within the cycle or disrupt it entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift between towering canopies, boom through caverns, and track the echoes of a <strong>long-abandoned human terraforming attempt.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Discover the beauty and brutality of a living ecosystem.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flora, fauna, and environment interact in surprising and systemic ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action ripples through the world.  Nature will <strong>remember.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush valleys flood with seasonal blooms, predators stalk under the cover of darkness, and storms force you to rethink your movement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0a Speak the Language of the Wild </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your power\u2014<strong>create, destroy, and understand.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\ud83d\udce1 Echolocate</i></strong><i> \u2013 Reveal the hidden. Map the unknown.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udde3 <strong>Shout</strong> \u2013 Send shockwaves through the land itself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Whisper</strong> \u2013 Form bonds that  last a lifetime\u2026 or shatter in an instant.</i> </p>","developers":["Connor Wall"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3221630/header.jpg?t=1748993364","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3221630/863512/6b23ec2505c40f9fcbe6ff8b409abdae7e0595fb/1750882238/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743785346","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3221630/863512/6b23ec2505c40f9fcbe6ff8b409abdae7e0595fb/1750882238/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743785346","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3221630/8